WEBVTT

00:04:29.089 --> 00:04:30.771
Antibiotics were only allowed

00:04:30.795 --> 00:04:33.513
when a veterinarian determined
the animal was sick.

00:04:34.168 --> 00:04:35.327
Sounds great, right?

00:04:35.351 --> 00:04:36.521
Problem solved.

00:04:36.545 --> 00:04:38.012
No, wait, not so fast.

00:04:38.625 --> 00:04:41.220
As soon as the reduction program started,

00:04:41.244 --> 00:04:43.252
it was very quickly discovered

00:04:43.276 --> 00:04:45.633
that antibiotics had been
the perfect blanket

00:04:45.657 --> 00:04:47.905
to cover up a lot of bad farm practices.

00:04:48.276 --> 00:04:50.204
More and more animals became sick

00:04:50.228 --> 00:04:52.895
and needed to be
cured with ... antibiotics.

00:04:53.347 --> 00:04:55.791
So instead of the total amount going down,

00:04:55.815 --> 00:04:57.282
it actually increased.

00:04:57.879 --> 00:05:00.156
Surely, that was not the way to go.